<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰγωγ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leading on,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πειθώ</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ ἄμετρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					32.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ δήμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>producing, dispensing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πάντων π.,</span> of God, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				3.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<i>pander, pimp,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1028
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1079
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.184
			</span></i>, etc.: fem., <i>procuress,</i> ibid., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				341
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., in
			good sense, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.64
			</span></i>.</div>
